hadiths[43]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1337","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo chandi ke bartan mein peeta hai wo to apne pet mein Jahannam ki aag ugar raha hai."
"1338","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein saat ka hukm diya aur saat se mana farmaya: Hamein beemar ki ayadat, janaze ke peechhe chalne, chheenkne wale ko jawab dene, bulane wale ka jawab dene, salam phailane, mazloom ki madad, qasam khane wale ki qasam poori karne ka hukm diya. Aur hamein sone ki angoothiyon se, chandi mein peene se, ya farmaya: Chandi ke bartanon se, reshmi gaddiyon aur qassi se, reshmi, deebaj aur istabraq pehenne se mana farmaya."
"1339","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa se Abd al-Rahman bin Abi Laila ke hawale se riwayat hai ke wo Huzaifa ke paas they. Phir unhon ne pani manga. Phir Majusi ne unhe pilaya. Phir jab us ne pyala un ke hath mein rakha to usے us par phenka. Aur farmaya: Agar main use ek ya do martaba se zyada mana na karta, goya kehte hain main ne ye na kiya hota. Lekin main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Reshmi aur deebaj na pehno. Sone aur chandi ke bartanon mein na piyo. Na un ke pyalon mein khayiye. Kyunke wo un ke liye duniya mein hain aur hamare liye Aakhirat mein."
"1340","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin al-Khattab ne masjid ke darwaze ke paas resham-dar joda dekha. To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kash tum ise khareedte aur Juma ke din aur wafd ke aane par pehente jab wo tumhare paas aayein. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ye to wahi pehenta hai jis ka Aakhirat mein koi hissa nahi. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas us mein se jode aaye. Phir Aap ne Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ko us mein se joda diya. To Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum ne mujhe pehnaya jabke tum ne Utarid ke jode ke bare mein jo kaha kaha tha? Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main ne tumhe pehnane ke liye nahi diya. Phir Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne use Makkah mein apne mushrik bhai ko pehnaya."
"1341","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar se Abu Usman al-Nahdi ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamare paas Utba bin Farqad ke sath Azarbaijan mein Umar ka khat aaya: Ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne reshmi se mana farmaya magar aise. Aur Aap ne apni un dono ungliyon se ishara farmaya jo angoothe se milti hain. Unhon ne kaha: Hum jante hain ke Aap ka matlab nishan hain."
"1342","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe resham-dar joda hadiya kiya. Phir main ne use pehna. Phir main ne Aap ke chehre mein ghussa dekha. Phir main ne use apni aurton ke darmiyan phaad diya."
"1343","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein reshmi pehne wo Aakhirat mein use nahi pehnega."
"1344","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko reshmi farruj hadiya kiya gaya. Phir Aap ne use pehna aur us mein namaz parhi. Phir phire aur use sakhti se kheench kar utaara goya use na-pasand karte hue. Aur farmaya: Ye parhezgaron ke liye jayez nahi."
"1345","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abd al-Rahman bin Auf aur Zubair ko reshmi qamees mein ijazat di, us khujli ki wajah se jo un dono mein thi."
"1346","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se Qatada ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne un se kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kaun se kapde sab se mehboob they? Unhon ne kaha: Dharidar chadar."
"1347","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Abu Burda ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aisha ne hamare paas kambal aur mota tehband nikala. Phir unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki rooh in dono mein qabz hui."
"1348","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas numda bistar hain? Main ne kaha: Hamare paas numda bistar kahan honge? Aap ne farmaya: Suno! Tumhare paas anqareeb numda bistar honge. Phir main us se kehta hun [matlab apni biwi se]: Apne numda bistar mujh se door karo. Phir wo kehti hai: Kya Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne nahi farmaya: Beshak tumhare paas numda bistar honge? Phir main use chhorta hun."
"1349","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah us ki taraf nahi dekhega jo apna kapda takabbur se ghaseete."
"1350","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Qayamat ke din us ki taraf nahi dekhega jo apna tehband ghamand se ghaseete."
"1351","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Qasim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi jode mein chalta hai jabke us ka dil use achha lagta hai, apne baalon ko sanwarta hua, to Allah use dhansa deta hai. Phir wo Qayamat ke din tak dhansता rehta hai."
"1352","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne sone ki angoothi se mana farmaya."
"1353","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sone ki angoothi banwayi. Aur Aap use pehente, us ke nag ko apni hatheli ke andar rakhte. Phir logon ne banwayi. Phir Aap mimbar par baithe aur use utaara. Phir farmaya: Beshak main ye angoothi pehenta tha aur us ke nag ko andar rakhta tha. Phir use phenk diya. Phir farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Main use kabhi nahi pehnunga. Phir logon ne apni angoothiyan phenk deen."
"1354","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chandi ki angoothi banwayi. Aur wo Aap ke hath mein thi. Phir baad mein Abu Bakr ke hath mein thi. Phir baad mein Umar ke hath mein thi. Phir baad mein Usman ke hath mein thi, yahan tak ke baad mein Arees ke kunwein mein giri. Us ka naqsh tha [Muhammad Rasulullah]."
"1355","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne angoothi banwayi. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak hum ne angoothi banwayi hai. Aur us mein naqsh banwaya hai. Phir us par koi naqsh na banaye. Unhon ne kaha: Phir beshak main us ki chamak Aap ki chhoti ungli mein dekhta hun."
"1356","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kitab likhi ya likhne ka irada farmaya. Phir Aap se kaha gaya: Wo kitab nahi parhte magar mohar lagi hui. Phir Aap ne chandi ki angoothi banwayi, us ka naqsh tha [Muhammad Rasulullah]. Goya main us ki safedi Aap ke hath mein dekhta hun."
"1357","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hath mein chandi ki angoothi dekhi, ek din. Phir logon ne chandi ki angoothiyan banwayein aur pehnein. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni angoothi phenk di. Phir logon ne apni angoothiyan phenk deen."
"1358","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi joota pehne to dayein se ibtida kare. Aur jab utaare to bayein se ibtida kare. Taake dayan pehle pehni jaye aur aakhir mein utari jaye."
"1359","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi ek jooti mein na chale. Dono ko utaare ya dono ko pehne."
"1360","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko masjid mein chit lete dekha, apna ek paon doosre par rakhe hue."
"1361","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mana farmaya ke mard za'faran lagaye."
"1362","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Yahood aur Nasara rang nahi lagate. Phir un ki mukhalifat karo."
"1363","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Talha (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahi hote jis mein kutta aur tasweeron ki murat ho."
"1364","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Talha se Busr bin Sa'id ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Zaid bin Khalid al-Juhani ne unhe bayan kiya, jabke Busr bin Sa'id ke sath Ubaidullah al-Khaulani they, jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) ki god mein they. Zaid bin Khalid ne un dono se bayan kiya ke Abu Talha ne unhe bayan kiya ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahi hote jis mein tasweer ho. Busr ne kaha: Phir Zaid bin Khalid beemar hue. Phir hum ne un ki ayadat ki. Phir hum un ke ghar mein tasweeron wala parda paye. Phir main ne Ubaidullah al-Khaulani se kaha: Kya unhon ne hamein tasweeron ke bare mein bayan nahi kiya tha? To unhon ne kaha: Beshak unhon ne kaha: Siwaye kapde mein naqsh ke. Kya tum ne use nahi suna? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahi, unhon ne zikr kiya tha."
"1365","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) safar se tashreef laye jabke main ne apne chat par apni chadar se parda kiya tha jis mein muratein thein. Phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use dekha to use phaad diya. Aur farmaya: Qayamat ke din sab se sakht azab walे wo honge jo Allah ki makhlooq se mushabehat karte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum ne use takiya ya do takiye banaye."
"1366","[AI-translation] Umm al-Muminin Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne tasweeron wala gadda khareeda. Phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use dekha to darwaze par khade ho gaye aur dakhil na hue. Phir main ne Aap ke chehre mein na-pasandeedgi pehchani. Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Main Allah aur Us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf tauba karti hun. Main ne kya gunah kiya? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Is gadde ka kya haal hai? Main ne arz kiya: Main ne use tumhare liye khareeda taake tum us par baitho aur tek lagao. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak in tasweeron wale Qayamat ke din azab diye jayenge. Phir un se kaha jayega: Jo tum ne paida kiya use zinda karo. Aur farmaya: Beshak jis ghar mein tasweerein hon us mein farishte dakhil nahi hote."
"1367","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak jo ye tasweerein banate hain unhe Qayamat ke din azab diya jayega. Un se kaha jayega: Jo tum ne paida kiya use zinda karo."
"1368","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak Allah ke nazdeek Qayamat ke din sab se sakht azab walे tasweer banane wale hain."
"1369","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se Sa'id bin Abi al-Hasan ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas ke paas tha jab un ke paas ek shakhs aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Abu Abbas! Beshak main insan hun, meri rozi mere hath ki san'at se hai. Aur beshak main ye tasweerein banata hun. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Main tumhe wahi bayan karunga jo main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna. Main ne Aap ko farmate suna: Jo tasweer banaye to beshak Allah use azab dega yahan tak ke us mein rooh phoonke. Aur wo us mein kabhi phoonkne wala nahi. Phir wo shakhs sakht ghabraya aur us ka chehra peela ho gaya. To unhon ne kaha: Tum par afsos! Agar tum banane ke siwa inkar karo to tum par ye darakht lazim hain, har cheez jis mein rooh nahi."
"1370","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah se Abu Zur'a ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Hurairah ke sath Madina mein ghar mein dakhil hua. Phir us ke upar tasweer banane wale ko tasweer banate dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Aur us se zyada zalim kaun hai jo meri makhlooq jaisi makhlooq banane jaye? Phir dana banayein, zarra banayein."
"1371","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bashir al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Aap ke kuchh safaron mein they, jabke log apne thaharne mein they. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qasid bheja ke oont ki gardan mein taant ki haar ya haar na rehne paye magar kaati jaye."
"1372","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Umm Sulaim ke haan beta paida hua to unhon ne mujh se kaha: Ae Anas! Is ladke ko dekho. Wo koi cheez na paye yahan tak ke tum use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas subah le jao taake Wo use ghutti dein. Phir main use subah lekar gaya. Phir Wo bagh mein they jabke Aap par Huraythiya chadar thi. Aur Wo us maal ko dagh rahe they jo Fatah mein Aap ke paas aaya tha."
"1373","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko qaza se manع farmate suna."
"1374","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Raston par baithne se bacho. To unhon ne arz kiya: Hamare liye zaroori hai, ye to hamari majlisein hain jin mein hum baatein karte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Phir jab tum majlison ke siwa inkar karo to raste ko us ka haq do. Unhon ne arz kiya: Aur raste ka haq kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nazar jhukana, takleef rokna, salam ka jawab dena, neki ka hukm aur burayi se rokna."
"1375","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha. Phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri beti ko khasra hua aur us ke baal jhad gaye. Aur beshak main ne us ka nikah kiya hai. To kya main us mein jodun? To Aap ne farmaya: Allah jodne wali aur judwane wali par lanat kare."
"1376","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Ansar mein se ek aurat ne apni beti ka nikah kiya. Phir us ke sar ke baal jhad gaye. Phir wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur Aap se is ka zikr kiya. Phir us ne kaha: Beshak us ke shohar ne mujhe hukm diya hai ke main us ke baalon mein jodun. To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Beshak jodne waliyon par lanat hui hai."
"1377","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Allah godne waliyon, gudwane waliyon, bhawon ukhadne waliyon aur husn ke liye daanton mein kushadgi karne waliyon par lanat kare, Allah ki makhlooq ko badalne waliyon par. Phir ye Bani Asad mein se ek aurat ko pahunchا jise Umm Ya'qub kaha jata hai. Phir wo aayi. Phir us ne kaha: Beshak mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke tum ne aisa aur aisa lanat ki. To unhon ne kaha: Aur mujhe kya hai ke main us par lanat na karun jis par Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne lanat farmayi, aur jo Allah ki kitab mein hai? To us ne kaha: Beshak main ne dono takhtiyon ke darmiyan parha hai aur us mein nahi paya jo tum kehte ho. To unhon ne kaha: Agar tum ne use parha hota to use pate. Kya tum ne nahi parha [aur jo Rasool tumhe de use lo, jis se tumhe manع kare us se ruko]? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak Aap ne us se mana farmaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir beshak main tumhare ghar walon ko use karte dekhti hun. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jao aur dekho. Phir wo gayi aur dekha. Phir apni hajat mein se kuchh na dekha. To unhon ne kaha: Agar wo aisi hoti to hum se na milti."
"1378","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan se Humaid bin Abd al-Rahman ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan ko us saal jab unhon ne hajj kiya, mimbar par suna. Phir unhon ne baalon ka joda pakda jo sipahi ke hathon mein tha. Phir farmaya: Ae Madina walo! Tumhare ulama kahan hain? Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko is jaisi se manع farmate suna. Aur Aap farmate: Bani Israil isi waqt halak hue jab un ki aurton ne use apnaya."
"1379","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri sautan hai. To kya mujh par gunah hai agar main apne shohar se jo us ne mujhe nahi diya kha kar dikhayun? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo na diye hue se sairab dikhaye wo jhoot ke do kapde pehenne wale jaisa hai."
